WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.436 --> 00:00:03.119
Lesson eight. Transport!

2
00:00:04.029 --> 00:00:11.229
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:14.232
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.282 --> 00:00:17.596
Today we learn: Transport! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.944 --> 00:00:22.244
Car! Say it with me. Car!

6
00:00:26.314 --> 00:00:29.814
Bus! Say it with me. Bus!

7
00:00:33.757 --> 00:00:36.974
Bike! Say it with me. Bike!

8
00:00:40.969 --> 00:00:44.586
Train! Say it with me. Train!

9
00:00:48.594 --> 00:00:51.644
Boat! Say it with me. Boat!

10
00:00:55.611 --> 00:00:59.094
Plane! Say it with me. Plane!

11
00:01:03.337 --> 00:01:07.170
Taxi! Say it with me. Taxi!

12
00:01:10.926 --> 00:01:14.259
Truck! Say it with me. Truck!

13
00:01:18.315 --> 00:01:23.524
Listen. I go to school by bus.

14
00:01:23.574 --> 00:01:27.094
Say it with me. I go to school by bus.

15
00:01:31.849 --> 00:01:37.653
The red bus takes children safely to school every morning. A big truck carries boxes.

16
00:01:37.703 --> 00:01:39.033
I like this story!

17
00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:45.098
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.148 --> 00:01:46.298
Bike!

19
00:01:47.122 --> 00:01:52.299
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:52.349 --> 00:01:53.499
Plane!

21
00:01:54.464 --> 00:01:59.899
Value corner: Teamwork. Working together with others helps us do great things.

22
00:01:59.949 --> 00:02:01.633
I can show teamwork too!

23
00:02:02.396 --> 00:02:09.588
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:11.216
Bye-bye, friends!

